# Feature branches

- Non-trivial work uses a `feature/<slug>` branch — do not land it directly on `main`.
- Keep CI green before merging to `main`.

**Authority:** [`CONTRIBUTING.md`](../../CONTRIBUTING.md) (feature-branch policy, testing, PR expectations). This file is a Cursor adapter only. Squash defaults: `merge-strategy.mdc`. After merge: `land-and-return.mdc`.
